==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Donphan|72}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*'''Rolling Spin''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Donphan|112}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

